## Copy to local.properties (gitignored) and fill in your DEVELOPMENT key.
## Never commit the real key.
##
## Google Cloud Console:
## 1. Enable only "Maps SDK for Android" for MAP-1.
## 2. Create an API key restricted to Android apps:
##    package: com.passengerapp
##    SHA-1: your debug keystore fingerprint
##
## Generate debug SHA-1 (Windows example):
##   keytool -list -v -keystore android/app/debug.keystore -alias androiddebugkey -storepass android -keypass android

sdk.dir=C:\\Users\\YOUR_USER\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
GOOGLE_MAPS_ANDROID_API_KEY=
